  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      463.99,
      286.71,
      574.88
    ],
    "text": "Description of the Land or Servitude to be acquired: Six (6) allotments below name land shown in Preliminary Plan No. Ku. 2300 and 27.02.2014, prepared by the Surveyor General, situated in the village of Kuleepitiya and Minor Division of Udapola Othota East Korale in the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 933 Serapiecewatta in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Polgahawela, in the District of Kurunegala in North Western Province.",
